done	<str>The Guildmaster of the Champions' Guild said I could earn the right to wear rune armour if I went on a quest for Oziach, who makes the armour.</str>
done	<str>I spoke to Oziack in Edgeville. He told me to slay the dragon of Crandor island.</str>
done	<str>The Champions’ Guild Guildmaster told me I had to find three pieces of a map to Crandor, a ship, a captain to take me there and a shield to protect me from the dragon’s breath.</str>
done	<str>I found the piece of the map that was hidden in Melzar’s Maze.</str>
done	<str>I found the piece of the map that was hidden beneath Ice Mountain.</str>
done	<str>I found the piece of the map that the goblin, Wormbrain, stole.</str>
done	<str>The Duke of Lumbridge gave me an anti-dragonbreath shield.</str>
done	<str>I have found a secret passage leading from Karamja to Crandor, so I no longer need to worry about finding a seaworthy ship and captain to take me there.</str>
done	<str>I sailed to Crandor and killed the dragon. I am now a true champion and have proved myself worthy to wear rune platemail!</str>
done	<col=ff0000>QUEST COMPLETE!</col>
